{"text": "From: Renata Kovac <rkovac@vantagepointsurvey.example>\nTo: Samuel Oduya <soduya@vantagepointsurvey.example>\nCc: bookings@wayfarercorp.example\nDate: Thu, 16 Apr 2026 16:42:10 -0600\nSubject: Lisbon - your bookings, and the hotel refund (need 2 things from you)\n\nSam,\n\nEverything for Lisbon is ticketed. Details below so you have them in one place. Please don't forward this one, it has the card on it.\n\nFLIGHTS (booked through Wayfarer Corporate Travel, agent Duarte Horvat, 720-555-0114)\n  Record locator QX7RLM, e-ticket 047 2218840963\n  Sun 10 May  DEN-EWR-LIS, arrive Mon 11 May 07:35. Seat 23C on the long leg.\n  Sat 16 May  LIS-EWR-DEN\n  Fare $1,486.30. Name on the ticket is exactly as in your passport: ODUYA/SAMUEL CHUKWUEMEKA.\n  Passport A04418827, expires 22 NOV 2031. Date of birth on file 14 AUG 1983.\n  Known Traveler Number TT9K41R7Z is on the booking, so TSA PreCheck should print. Your Global Entry card number is not needed.\n  Frequent flyer: I added MP-88 204 771.\n\nHOTEL\n  Alfama Miradouro Hotel, Rua das Escolas Gerais 41, 1100-213 Lisbon. 5 nights, in 11 May 2026, out the 16th.\n  Confirmation HAM-260511-7729. Rate €164,00 a night, city tax extra. Front desk +351 21 555 0164.\n\nPAYMENT\n  All of it is on the company Mastercard in my name:\n     5122 3096 5238 7421   exp 09/28   security code 417\n     billing ZIP 80202\n  The hotel will ask to see the card at check-in. Show them this email and have them ring me on (303) 555-0186 if they refuse. Do NOT put the room on your own card again.\n\nTHE REFUND (this is what I need you for)\n  Last year the Alfama took the €492,00 deposit twice, once from the company card and once by transfer from your wife's account when the card was declined. They have finally agreed to send it back, but only to the account it came from. They need, in writing:\n  1. Account holder: Ifeoma Oduya\n  2. IBAN: I have PT29 5473 7348 2822 1041 9695 4 at Banco Ribeira do Tejo from the old receipt. Is that still open? Ifeoma said she might have closed it when her mother's flat in Cascais was sold.\n  3. A signed line from her. Email is fine: reservas@alfamamiradouro.example, quote the 2025 folio F-25-03318.\n  When it lands, tell me the amount in dollars so I can clear the open item (it was coded as $531.36).\n\nEXPENSES\n  Per diem is $92 a day. Conference fee ($780.00, FIG Working Week) is already paid. Receipts into Concur by May 29, please, not June.\n\nAlso: Dr. Oduya, the medical form you sent me by mistake (the one about the insulin pump) is deleted. I did not open the attachment. You may want a doctor's letter for security at DEN.\n\nRenata\n\nRenata Kovac | Office & Travel Coordinator\nVantage Point Surveying, Inc. | 1701 Wynkoop Street, Suite 640, Denver, CO 80202\ndirect 303-555-0186 | https://travel.vantagepointsurvey.example/trips/LIS-0526-oduya", "kind": "Email", "detail": "463 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Renata Kovac", "Samuel Oduya", "Duarte Horvat", "SAMUEL CHUKWUEMEKA", "Ifeoma Oduya", "Dr. Oduya"], "companies": ["Vantagepointsurvey", "Wayfarer Corporate Travel", "Wayfarer Corporate", "Alfama", "Banco Ribeira do Tejo", "Vantage Point Surveying, Inc."]}, "topics": {"places": ["Lisbon", "DEN", "EWR", "LIS", "Cascais", "Denver"], "health": ["insulin pump"], "sensitive": ["Passport A04418827", "14 AUG 1983", "billing ZIP 80202", "race or ethnicity"], "names": ["Renata", "Samuel", "Ifeoma", "Kovac"]}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.9000000022351742, "modelMs": 0, "topicMs": 35121.199999999255, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "card_partial", "phone", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "street", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "names", "sensitive_topics"], "detections": [{"start": 6, "end": 18, "text": "Renata Kovac", "kind": "person", "source": "model", "canonical": "Renata